# Changelog: tramaj-cli

Release history of `tramaj-cli`, the Node.js command-line interface built on the PureScript package. Releases happen when there are
major changes rather than on a schedule; each entry below is one version.
Every implementation has its own page like this one, and each page is
tagged so the site builds one Atom feed per implementation:
#changelog #purescript #tramaj-cli

=base:main-content.tramaj-doc
@version=import("changelog/version", {"package": "tramaj-cli"})
.div(class: "changelog",
  $version({
      "version": "(none)",
      "date": "unreleased",
      "summary": "Bundled with spago; no registry release yet.",
      "changes": [
          {
              "kind": "added",
              "text": "Template file + JSON context file to evaluated Node JSON on stdout, with \`--lib name=file\` libraries and \`--watch\`."
          },
          {
              "kind": "added",
              "text": "\`analyze imports|actions|holes|unsupplied|constraints\` subcommands over the static analyses."
          }
      ]
  }).rendered)

